    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリクリスエス",
            "enName": "Symboli Kris S",
            "jpText": "――Birthday partyへの参加、\n――感謝する。",
            "enText": "Thank you for agreeing to attend \nmy birthday party.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 3880041577298150724,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリクリスエス",
            "enName": "Symboli Kris S",
            "jpText": "日々の恩を伝える場。\n今夜は――楽しんでくれ。",
            "enText": "This will be my way of giving back to you. \nSo please, enjoy tonight.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 7233878924561964593,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "こちらこそ、招待ありがとう。",
            "enText": "Well, thank you for inviting me.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -8274566682257254121,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "不慣れなこともあるだろう、\n今日の会場ならいくらか顔も利く、\n何かあればぜひ頼ってくれ。",
            "enText": "In case there's anything you're unsure about,\nI know my way around the venue, so don't \nhesitate to ask.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -6347862183057737965,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シリウスシンボリ",
            "enName": "Sirius Symboli",
            "jpText": "ハ、誕生日会まで仕切るつもりか？\nホストはクリスエスだろうが。",
            "enText": "Hah, even a birthday party isn't safe \nfrom your power grabs. Kris S is the host, \nnot you.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 233601484609522556,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "……そうだな。すまない、悪癖が出たようだ。\n今日はゲストとして楽しませてもらうよ。",
            "enText": "…You're right. Sorry, it's a bad habit \nof mine. I will enjoy tonight as a guest \nand nothing more.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 4884302026981507752,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリクリスエス",
            "enName": "Symboli Kris S",
            "jpText": "――ああ。――期待していい。\n――シリウスの協力で、準備は万全だ。",
            "enText": "Yes, please look forward to it. Thanks to \nSirius's help, everything is in order.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 8025113488637509376,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "…………ほう？",
            "enText": "…Oh?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 5936830550952393330,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シリウスシンボリ",
            "enName": "Sirius Symboli",
            "jpText": "チッ。\n言うな。言わなくていい。",
            "enText": "Tch. Quiet. You don't have to tell her.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 4655750254236263023,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "構わない、聞かせてくれ。",
            "enText": "Please do, I'd love to hear more.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 5632861351128990689,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリクリスエス",
            "enName": "Symboli Kris S",
            "jpText": "――私が不得手な箇所は、全て彼女が。\nサプライズの小型飛行機の運転も――",
            "enText": "She handled everything I was unsure about. \nShe's even going to pilot the surprise airplane.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -5683568919500283869,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シリウスシンボリ",
            "enName": "Sirius Symboli",
            "jpText": "オイ！",
            "enText": "Hey!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": -1004902479952836448,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
